OL,3,GNEWSAHoliday hunger bill to face final
OL,4,AStormont hurdle
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposed law which would help poorer
OL,7,Ffamilies with food costs during school
OL,8,Fholidays is to face its final hurdle in
OL,9,Fthe Northern Ireland Assembly on
OL,10,FTuesday.
OL,12,FSome parents and charities have
OL,13,Fwelcomed the Holiday Meal Payments
OL,14,FBill, which was brought forward by Sinn
OL,15,FFein's Danny Baker.
OL,17,FIt would create a new payment for
OL,18,Ffamilies whose children receive free
OL,19,Fschool meals, which would be made
OL,20,Foutside of term time to help with the
OL,21,Fcost of food.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
