OL,3,GNEWSAHoliday hunger bill to face final
OL,4,AStormont hurdle
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Democratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,7,FEducation Minister Paul Givan has been
OL,8,Fconsistently critical of the
OL,9,Flegislation, warning it will
OL,10,Fimmediately cost his budget #25m to
OL,11,F#30m a year at a time when all
OL,12,Fdepartments are struggling financially.
